      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityneighborhoods.nyc/parkchester",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 6‑train station at Metropolitan Avenue gives residents direct access to Manhattan, a feature highlighted in Web source 1.",
